{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國馬薩諸塞州民主黨參議員愛德華·馬基（Edward J． Markey）周一致信谷歌，要求這家科技巨頭允許學校關閉其搜尋引擎中的人工智能功能。這封信援引了上周的一篇報道。報道稱，谷歌計劃默認關閉學生對部分人工智能相關服務的訪問權限，包括其Gemini人工智能工具和搜索服務，同時允許學校自行決定是否重新啓用這些服務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585612.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.794214+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:20:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_hash":"af12826018a38dd916c6d9fa648194f7d059d0d85b4ff9cfaf4afb4c8b0aa208","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}